info.description:
Zimbabwe's premier lifestyle platform - Restaurant deals, event ticketing, membership subscriptions, and diaspora support.

**Note**: All successful API responses are wrapped in a standard envelope:
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": { ...payload... },
  "message": "Optional success message"
}
```
All error responses follow:
```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": { "code": "ERROR_CODE", "message": "Human readable message" }
}
```
